<span begin="1:45.587" end="1:45.785">な</span><span begin="1:45.785" end="1:46.633">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这比想象中的还要美妙 我终于不再对影自怜</span></p><p begin="1:46.897" end="1:49.885" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.897" end="1:47.017">行</span><span begin="1:47.017" end="1:47.195">く</span><span begin="1:47.195" end="1:47.365">よ</span><span begin="1:47.365" end="1:47.557">ジャン</span><span begin="1:47.557" end="1:47.709">プ</span><span begin="1:47.709" end="1:47.909">ジャン</span><span begin="1:47.909" end="1:48.038">プ</span><span begin="1:48.038" end="1:48.203">ジャン</span><span begin="1:48.203" end="1:48.365">プ</span> <span begin="1:48.365" end="1:48.599">跳</span><span begin="1:48.599" end="1:48.770">ね</span><span begin="1:48.770" end="1:48.977">る</span><span begin="1:48.977" end="1:49.157">ダン</span><span begin="1:49.157" end="1:49.327">ス</span><span begin="1:49.327" end="1:49.426">ダン</span><span begin="1:49.426" end="1:49.582">ス</span><span begin="1:49.582" end="1:49.741">ダン</span><span begin="1:49.741" end="1:49.885">ス</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们一起蹦蹦跳跳舞动起来</span></p><p begin="1:50.058" end="1:53.336" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.058" end="1:50.194">い</span><span begin="1:50.194" end="1:50.335">ら</span><span begin="1:50.335" end="1:50.622">な</span><span begin="1:50.622" end="1:50.781">い</span><span begin="1:50.781" end="1:50.964">不</span><span begin="1:50.964" end="1:51.162">安</span><span begin="1:51.353" end="1:51.744">なん</span><span begin="1:51.744" end="1:51.912">て</span><span begin="1:51.912" end="1:52.314">踏ん</span><span begin="1:52.314" end="1:52.731">じゃっ</span><span begin="1:52.731" end="1:52.894">て</span><span begin="1:52.894" end="1:53.002">こ</span><span begin="1:53.002" end="1:53.336">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将我们不必要的焦虑统统踩在脚下</span></p><p begin="1:53.575" end="1:56.568" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.575" end="1:53.912">あぁ</